        a.sub-title(href="http://www.goodlylabs.org/", target="_blank") Goodly Labs - Berkeley Institute of Data Science
        .position UX, Web Development and Database Design • 2018
        .blurb I worked on two different research teams:
            a.sub-link(href="http://www.goodlylabs.org/research-projects/decidingforce/", target="_blank") The Deciding Force
            | that classifies information from more than 8,000 news articles describing more than 35,000 events which police and the Occupy movement interacted, and on
            a.sub-link(href="git http://www.goodlylabs.org/research-projects/capitolquery/", target="_blank") Capital Query
            | that organizes the difficult-to-research Congressional record into a well-organized, easy-to-query database.

